      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9609174",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We prove the universality of correlation functions of chiral unitary and unitary ensembles of ran- dom matrices in the microscopic limit. The essence of the proof consists in reducing the three-term recursion relation for the relevant orthogonal polynomials into a Bessel equation governing the local asymptotics around the origin. The possible physical interpretation as the universality of soft spectrum of the Dirac operator is brieﬂy discussed. PACS: 05.45.+b, 11.15.Pg, 11.30.Rd e-mail addresses: ∗akemann@itp.uni-hannover.de, † phdamg, ‡ umagnea, § shinsuke@alf.nbi.dk",
